** Window selection (ace-window replacement)
Replaces the abo-abo/ace-window dependency (idea: abo-abo, code: new
here, no ace-window code copied): window jump as a key-selection
action over live windows. Labels use ~ks-keys~ (colemark home row,
better than ace's numeric defaults); the ~avy~ dependency ace-window
needed is already gone since this engine replaced avy throughout.
Prefix behavior mirrors ace-window UX: plain jump, =C-u= swaps
buffers with the chosen window, =C-u C-u= deletes it. Minibuffer
windows are excluded from candidates.
